WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
narrator: Stock Tailscale joins this local test control plane.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:18.000
narrator: Two containers use the fixture's preauthorization key.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:38.000
narrator: Native Rust DERP shares the control server's HTTPS listener.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:00.000
narrator: Certificate setup is local to this Docker fixture.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:24.000
narrator: The harness requests registration and waits for peer visibility.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:50.000
narrator: Tailscale ping is the reachability check.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:19.000
narrator: Read the final result; timing varies with container startup.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:51.000
narrator: This mesh test does not purchase traffic or settle OCT.
